ing. On this adventure, topple a manufacturing empire over the course of 100+ levels and 6 worlds, rescuing Boggies, collecting treats, digging holes, and much more along the way!","steam_appid":2450290,"support_info":{"email":"support@niknokination-collaboration.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.niknokination-collaboration.com/"}